cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Smart Radar System"
abstract: >
  An Arduino-based ultrasonic radar system that scans its surroundings with a
  servo-mounted HC-SR04 sensor, streams live distance data over serial, and
  renders it as a real-time sweeping radar display using Processing.
authors:
  - family-names: "Contributors"
    name: "Smart Radar Contributors"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<your-username>/Smart-Radar"
keywords:
  - arduino
  - radar
  - ultrasonic
  - hc-sr04
  - processing
  - embedded-systems
